+filler or repeating completed work. With zero researchers live, an exhausted
+packet ledger and the curator's curation still in progress, three genuinely
+distinct, untried angles were selected by checking the whole ledger for concept
+and keyword absence (all counts were 0):
+
+| Concept | Ledger hits before dispatch |
+|---|---|
+| meet-in-the-middle / Schroeppel-Shamir | 0 |
+| communication complexity (as evaluator resource barrier) | 0 |
+| Mobius / incidence algebra / spectral / representation theory | 0 |
